      "POUR the whisky into one tankard and fresh boiling water into the other.",
      "IGNITE the whisky using a long match and while still blazing pour the whisky into the other tankard.",
      "THROW the flaming mixture from one tankard to the other. (The foolhardy increase the distance between the tankards as they pour, thus creating a spectacular long blue flame between the two.)",
